    "title": "Vegetarian Freezer Meals for Families (No Meal Prep Day Needed) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Caitlin Havener Rogers ,\n1 days ago One freezer tip for the dahl and the chickpea lentil soup: both have potatoes, which can turn grainy in the freezer. If you’re making a batch to freeze, cut the potatoes small or leave them out. For the dahl, stir in the yogurt after you reheat it, not before you freeze it. Read full article",
